{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The sequel to Bad Dog, Good Time. This is a SFW sequel, please enjoy and thank you. After meeting Banjo at a party and hanging out with him, snuggling and sleeping next to him as a little spoon, you ended up going separate ways.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You had his number from a group-chat, but you broke your phone at work the next day, when getting a new phone, you lost your conversations and most of your contacts. You wondered if you'd ever see him again, does he think you ghosted him?\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You get a shot at romance in this novel. A second chance when you run into him at a Barkbucks Coffee shop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This point &amp; click game allows you to discover more about Banjo, his backstory as a character and generally who he is. You'll partake in multiple activities whether it be going to Barkbucks, nights watching the stars at the lake or simply just giving him a quick kiss.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Banjo likes little gifts and quality time, there are mini-game scenes where you can give tokens of friendship. You'll develop a romantic interest and maybe become partners by the end.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Pawsome Job","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4018920/2e81f510c78f41a59a98c3e61f23a8362a63f51f.jpg"},{"name":"Caught The Fish!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4018920/bd98987cf039ee4732d5f6657bd624e346796257.jpg"}],"total":2},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4018920?t=1760668982","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4018920?t=1760668982","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018920/1f548528c5e388a2064832849d4ec73ce82e9e18/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760668982","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018920/1f548528c5e388a2064832849d4ec73ce82e9e18/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760668982","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Conversation about some past experiences of being abused and sexually-assaulted."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The sequel to Bad Dog, Good Time. This is a SFW sequel, please enjoy and thank you. After meeting Banjo at a party and hanging out with him, snuggling and sleeping next to him as a little spoon, you ended up going separate ways.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You had his number from a group-chat, but you broke your phone at work the next day, when getting a new phone, you lost your conversations and most of your contacts. You wondered if you'd ever see him again, does he think you ghosted him?\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You get a shot at romance in this novel. A second chance when you run into him at a Barkbucks Coffee shop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This point &amp; click game allows you to discover more about Banjo, his backstory as a character and generally who he is. You'll partake in multiple activities whether it be going to Barkbucks, nights watching the stars at the lake or simply just giving him a quick kiss.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Banjo likes little gifts and quality time, there are mini-game scenes where you can give tokens of friendship. You'll develop a romantic interest and maybe become partners by the end.</p>","developers":["Bad Dog Banjo"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018920/5550394bfd26e75a6bf54030a09a3ab6f6e457de/header.jpg?t=1760668982","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimu